#
# Public export: keep the SEC owner runbooks out of `git archive` (the public
# tree). They name secret file paths and a tunnel-id prefix. Nested
# .gitattributes files are honoured by `git archive`, so this works alongside
# the root .gitattributes of swarm/launch-gates without a merge conflict.
# History still contains them: the public repo must start from the exported
# tree (fresh history), see SEC-1-HISTORY-PURGE.md.
SEC-*.md export-ignore
